{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:23:300","content":{"id":300,"title":"建议","content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"e9a08f35-cb2b-48b2-b1a6-8314d6faef01","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"关于信息源的建议："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"5e77284e-bfa2-4cce-8a5b-ca304495ff16","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"d9cb2d51-47ae-4d97-8e1c-685877c2da02","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"f0d32232-c693-42e2-b74f-7e8f19130a4c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"做减法，削减信息源"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"631398f7-b599-4f40-9b08-3b15619644c9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们现在缺的不是信息，而是高质量的信息，我们的注意力有限，不要被低质量的信息浪费了时间，因此要削减这部分的信息源"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"04251963-2924-4bed-b7d3-0d84cba218b9","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"b8f11019-536b-44b8-b444-05fe5c346b5d","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"81d4ca85-a136-4ba6-b420-21046199b395","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"削减利用情绪的信息源"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"64bd455a-8b39-45e2-b431-4897156058f0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"标题党，引发焦虑，带动情绪，扰乱正常规划和做事节奏"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"dda73755-f637-4ece-822a-167861ac0a9d","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"09f0a339-79eb-4b9e-a49c-c8a8e0f96242","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"削减觉得舒适的信息源"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"0a34a3ca-bf89-432c-a88e-2e7cf70c510e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"让人舒适的原因是什么，是因为观点和我们的看法相当一致，无法触发新的思考和改变了，此类信息源作用不大了"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"cab68e7a-a503-4924-b112-3b16292ad16e","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"0e1fbd77-b3cc-46bf-ae5b-c2be0320b332","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"削减缺乏事实依据的信息源"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"12e16239-66ed-49f5-bb55-f53d02508b27","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"信息中充满了大量的观点，暴论，但是缺乏事实依据，缺乏数据支撑，不可靠"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"c40cdc82-3099-422e-aa98-9bd0535b2410","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"354333c6-35a2-47fd-b68f-10c0d9eb7c57","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"做加法，增加书本之外的信息源"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"6485bfa6-c72a-4df7-9aa1-9ec5880cb104","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们获取高质量信息源的方式，最快的方式就是从书本、论文获取，但不可作为唯一的获取信息源的方式，书也有一些问题，从写作到出版，最少一年，对于一些日新月异的领域来说，太晚了，另外有一些是书中不会提的，需要在实践中总结的"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"bd616e10-e891-409b-9dfa-1aec7971eb8e","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"a30f6e95-19f3-4915-8190-2428ccebf6ef","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"492b91e0-d05b-4b63-ba1b-268bd1319677","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"他人作为信息源"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"2edd2ba0-4242-44d5-9bfe-5c99f7dcd669","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"从真正的实践者获取信息，多请教多观察，注意以下三点："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"5f99bf91-84c7-4338-97de-5822016b516b","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"237d6dc3-f123-4569-8f60-ef8ec4375e87","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"1e242ae2-955c-4efa-88d1-c53454135d5a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"关注细节，真正的实践者不会阐述宏大叙事，而是细节间的微妙联系"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"7b29ccc2-5e36-4472-857f-09ff558da57a","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"80b6f39c-3055-4055-bb15-0cb9da40cf20","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"关注失败，有的时候成功是天时地利人和，很难复制，但是失败都是有具体原因的，要吸取这些经验，少走弯路"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"5e9f3d63-4861-45ed-8850-4576135444dd","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"8b026ce6-21a9-4638-a0ea-c7e7fbe83a84","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"关注一手信息源，别看二手解读的文章，直接去看他人的演讲，文章，博客，报告"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"3996d8df-3321-4f09-bc0b-a3e4826c63a0","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"55483a5f-ee94-4ac0-8a74-c6f6ed7daabd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"亲自下场"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"48070916-4b4b-40c9-a490-cfce6e06813f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"亲自去观察，去调研，去总结经验，投入时间、投入精力，有的时候觉得自己准备充足了，但是下场才知道不了解的问题层出不穷，一定要亲身经历才有深刻感悟"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"bc04f4b6-f7f4-4db1-8278-d0b6e016228d","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"df032570-0d7f-4119-929d-c908d190011c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"做乘法，多个角度考察信息"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"87415158-24c4-4812-baf1-1f93b28f6805","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"77c51dec-7cf9-47d2-b2ca-c278b83d31d1","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"889c6165-f856-44d8-96dc-1e900fb0e28c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"考虑概念"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"ad6dce2b-2158-46fe-85e7-43a8b475c6d6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一个信息当我们向下挖，深入到某一个概念时，会发现我们对其一无所知，通过深挖概念我们可以对信息理解更准确"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"e7d8f9d1-192c-4298-a7eb-e17577bc0db5","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"e369af03-0aa3-4158-9727-de7f2c15de8f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"考察范式"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"c78c1378-de76-4fad-9dcb-97047413ed35","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"向上抽象看，找到可迁移的范式，别的领域的经验也可以成为本领域的解决方案，警惕范式不是假大空的大话，而是方法和思路"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"94311afd-8dfc-4971-96c7-69cd3e7363be","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"f563883e-4a7b-4c5d-94fc-b0678a07ea4b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"顺藤摸瓜"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"54db51a6-e846-41a4-aeab-45e98bb4f730","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"优质信息源的其他信息相对也是较为优质的，所参考的资料大概率也是优质的，顺藤摸瓜，汲取这些优质的信息源"}]}]}]}]}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"笔记的方法","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:275","type":"doc","id":275}},{"label":"收集篇，如何做筛选，获取高质量信息","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:297","type":"doc","id":297}},{"label":"建议","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:300","type":"doc","id":300}}],"prevPage":{"title":"原则","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:299","type":"doc","id":299}},"nextPage":{"title":"心法篇，以我为主，持续不断","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:301","type":"doc","id":301}},"createTime":1743910291790,"updateTime":1792337071163,"projectId":23},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1792337071163}}